    "text": "<div style=\"font-size: 10.5px; color: #8a8fa3; text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">Every unit in the squad follows this rule.</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:8px;border:1px solid rgba(169,183,201,0.45);background:rgba(169,183,201,0.07);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"flex:none;overflow:visible;\"><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#a9b7c9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#a9b7c9\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#a9b7c9\"/><path d=\"M5 20 V16.5 C5 14.5 19 14.5 19 16.5 V20 Z\" fill=\"#a9b7c933\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a9b7c9\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#a9b7c9;\">Horde</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:#a9b7c9;border:1px solid rgba(169,183,201,0.55);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;\">ARMY</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#e8e8ee;margin-top:4px;\">Every skill hit raises a skeleton that stays for the whole fight. Up to 5 stand. Enemy hits go to the shield skeletons first, then the warriors, then the Bone Knight. With 5 standing, a skill hit makes that kind stronger instead. A slam can still land on anyone.</div>\n    </div>"
